    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span><span class=\"time\">40 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip bad\">Hard</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Take or skip DP</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Binary search</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/maximum-profit-in-job-scheduling/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 1235</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Maximum Profit in Job Scheduling</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Sort jobs by end time; best[k] = best profit from the first k jobs. Each job is either skipped (best[k]) or taken after the last job that ends by its start (one binary search). House Robber on a timeline: O(n log n) time, O(n) space.</p>\n"
